      "id": 124426,
      "name": "Christopher",
      "username": "Christopher",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/christopher/{size}/1851_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-12-23T19:48:36.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Sure!</p><p>First off, we have Captain Cosmic:</p><p>![|250x350](upload://9wS226df4tAuMylR7WlloGlqi1d.jpeg)</p><p>Then, we have Sky-Scraper, who has three character cards and switches between them, based on what cards she plays:</p><p><span class=\"broken-image\" title=\"This image is broken\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-unlink svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#unlink\"></use></svg></span></p><p>Then, we have the four villains.</p><p>Deadline:</p><p>![|500x350](upload://4CH1H7eAHJbPb7aVDlVpEpVgMzg.jpeg)</p><p>Infinitor:</p><p>![|500x350](upload://lkwQP4rL3oKDBd00TtZvIuTTp37.jpeg)</p><p>Kaargra Warfang:</p><p>![|500x350](upload://6DXpGj3TXmIkgpZPLjRF1t7knT6.jpeg)</p><p>And last, but FAR from least, Progeny:</p><p>![|500x350](upload://aHNxN2bwffkZYq4hsezjyEo0h6Q.jpeg)</p><p>What about their flip-sides? Well, I'm not going to give you EVERYTHING.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-13T08:34:58.890Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 0.0,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 11736,
      "topic_slug": "wotc-character-cards",
      "display_username": "Christopher",
      "primary_group_name": null,
      "flair_name": null,
      "flair_url": null,
      "flair_bg_color": null,
      "flair_color": null,
      "flair_group_id": null,
      "badges_granted": [],
      "version": 2,
      "can_edit": false,
