      "can_recover": false,
      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Sure!</p><p>First off, we have Captain Cosmic:</p><p>![|250x350](upload://9wS226df4tAuMylR7WlloGlqi1d.jpeg)</p><p>Then, we have Sky-Scraper, who has three character cards and switches between them, based on what cards she plays:</p><p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/ALh5qkM.jpg\" width=\"750\" height=\"350\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" /></p><p>Then, we have the four villains.</p><p>Deadline:</p><p>![|500x350](upload://4CH1H7eAHJbPb7aVDlVpEpVgMzg.jpeg)</p><p>Infinitor:</p><p>![|500x350](upload://lkwQP4rL3oKDBd00TtZvIuTTp37.jpeg)</p><p>Kaargra Warfang:</p><p>![|500x350](upload://6DXpGj3TXmIkgpZPLjRF1t7knT6.jpeg)</p><p>And last, but FAR from least, Progeny:</p><p>![|500x350](upload://aHNxN2bwffkZYq4hsezjyEo0h6Q.jpeg)</p><p>What about their flip-sides? Well, I'm not going to give you EVERYTHING.</p>",
