      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "[quote=\"McBehrer\"]\n\nDepends on whether or not you are playing in advanced mode.\n\nOther things of note: Progeny is, in fact, Knyfe's nemesis, and the title deck is a part of Kaargra's setup.\n\n[/quote]\n\nWe also learned that when Christopher revealed Death-caller, as he specifically referred to it as a tithe from Kaargra's deck.\n\nMy guess is she operates by sending out monsters in her collosseum and we earn titles, and simultaneously earning the favor of the crowd. Once that's done, and enough titles are earned, the colloseum card text flips her, and the showdown begins. Hence the reason she isn't yet a target.\n\nAm I warm? :)",
